      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nI run test again as client got updated. (so 1913)\n\nI use following world as testing.\n\nAs per as test this time, I switch between public/beta and previous.\n\nAnd see regression still on public and beta (only bit laggy compare to previous branch) and not see issue with previous branch.\n\n*between beta and previous branch, diff be small so may not has bug possibly.\n\nI used Open Beta build while switching branch on SteamVR.\n\nAnd see some framerate increase on CPU/GPU could be something may can check.\n\nHope those info help on investigate.\n\nPerf heavy: \n\n*https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_53630b6e-2a56-4e06-a5e1-42ae8a554ffb\n\n*https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ed5a13e2-52a3-41c7-b026-db4d30eed6ea/info\n\nMany user example: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_bf51e60f-f372-48b1-a757-88ba8331d926",
