  "details": "There is more laggy with current latest SteamVR live branch (as of 12th Sep) while can be fixed by switch to other branch like known Connecting/Black Screen issue.\n\nTested in few worlds and seems having same behaviour when compare.\n\nAll of those world be either GPU/CPU perf heavy for note.",
